<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">JEM 60 Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Jemusi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya Jemusi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jemusi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jemusi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata ya Jemusi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Jemusi</para>
  <para style="imt">BUSANSULUSHI</para>
  <para style="ip">Libuku lya Jemusi lyalalembwa ne Jemusi. Uyu ni Jemusi mukwabo Yesu, walikuba mutangunishi mu mubungano wakutanguna, kayi walikuba umo wa bamakulene wa libunga lyamu Yelusalemu 15:13. Mutumwa Paulo walikumukuweti lusanda lwa mubungano mu Agalatiya 2:9. Bantu beshikuyanda kwishiba bingi bashoma kwambeti libuku lya Jemusi lyalalembwa kabitana bishika byaka makumi asanu kufuma pakusemwa kwa Klistu. Pakwinga Jemusi walikuba mutangunishi wa mubungano mu Yelusalemu, mpani libuku ili walalilemba mpwalikwikala kopeloko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jemusi mulibuku lyakendi walalembela mikowa likumi ne ibili yamwaikila mubishi nabimbi 1:1. Lwiyo luli muli Jemusi lukute kusebensa kuli baklistu bonse, nsombi kusebensesha maswi akwambeti “mikowa likumi” Alapeshengeti mpani walalembela baklistu Baciyuda. Pakwinga libuku ili lyalikuyandika kumwaiwa ku makoto angi a beshikulibelenga, ecebo cakendi lilambanga pa nkani shingi. Jemusi lashinga mano makamaka pa lwikatano luli pakati pa lushomo ne micito. Lushomo lwa ncinencine lwela kubonekela mu ncito 2:7. Kayi lacenjeshenga kutayandowa bantu babile 2:1-4 Kayi latwambilinga kucenjela ne ncetulambanga 3:1-12</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Jemusi lapanga mitende beshikubelenga kalata 1:1</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakonkapo layuminishinga baklistu kuba balimbikila bacana mapensho 1:2-27</para>
  <para style="io1">Kayi lambanga ncecainina kwambeti lushomo lubonekelenga kufumina mumicito 2:1-26</para>
  <para style="io1">Kufumapo lambanga maswi ncela kuba ne ngofu 3:1-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Kayi lambanga sha mano a Lesa ncapusana ne mano a cishi 3:13 mpaka 4:10</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakonkapo lacenjeshenga balabelengenga kutaba beshikulisumpula 4:11 mpaka 5:6</para>
  <para style="io1">Jemusi lapwishinga libuku lyakendi mu 5:7-20 pakubapa malailile.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Njame Jemusi musebenshi wa Lesa ne Mwami Yesu Klistu, ndamupanga mitende amwe mikowa likumi ne ibili yalamwaikila kubishi nabimbi.</para>
  <para style="s">Lushomo ne mano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mobanse, kondwani mwakumananga ne mapensho apusana pusana, <verse number="3" style="v"/>pakwinga mucinshi kwambeti na lushomo lwenu lubula kuntenkana pacindi ncomulapitinga mumapensho, nimukabe bantu beshikucikonsha kukoma. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kulimbikila kwenu kwelela kupitilisha mpaka mukabe balulama cakumpwililila. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nsombi na muntu naumbi liya mano pakati penu welela kusenga kuli Lesa, kayi nakatambule, pakwinga Lesa ukute kupa camakasa abili kuli bonse mwakubula kulangaula milandu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neco mwasenganga mwelela kushoma kwambeti nicikenshike kwakubula kutonshanya. Pakwinga uliyense latonshanyanga ulyeti mankape apamenshi ayo eshikwendeleshewa ne mukupwe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Muntu wamushoboyu katayeyeti nakapewe ncalasengenga kuli Mwami Lesa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pakwinga lasenge ne myoyo ibili, kayi nkaikalikana mubintu byonse, neco nkela kutambulapo ciliconse kuli Lesa sobwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Bukandu ne bubile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mwanse mukandu washoma, welela kukondwa na Lesa lamusumpulu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kayi mubile washoma welela kukondwa na Lesa lamuwishi. Pakwinga mubile nakapwe mbuli maluba amucisuwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lisuba lyapula likute kutenta mumena ne kulasha maluba panshi. Neco buyumi bwa mubile nibukapwe kacili pakati pa micito yakendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Shakwelekeshewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ukute colwe muntu ukute kali walimbikilowa elekeshewanga, pakwinga panyuma pakendi nakatambule buyumi, pakwinga ecilambo ico Lesa ncashomeshesha kupa bonse mbwasuni. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Muntu elekeshewanga katambangeti Lesa elamwelekeshenga sobwe, Lesa nkela kwelekeshewa ne byaipa, kayi nkela kwelekesha muntu ne byaipa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba muntu ukute kwelekeshewa nelunkumbwa lwakendi mwine,elukute kumubepa nekwimwikata nkola. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Neco lunkumbwa lukute kusema bwipishi, nabo bwipishi bwakula mushimba bukute kusema lufu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kamutabepwa mobanse bame. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Cipo ciliconse caina kayi caswepa cikute kufuma kwilu ku Bata bakute kwendelesha bintu byonse byakwilu. Nendi nkashinti mbuli mufunsha, kayi kumunika kwakendi nkakushinkililwa ne cintu ciliconse sobwe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mwakuyanda kwakendi walatupa buyumi bwa linolino kupitila mu maswi ancinencine kwambeti, afwe tubeti bisepo byakutanguna kutoma palibyo mbyalalenga.</para>
  <para style="s">Makani akunyumfwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, kamwikatishani maswi awa, uliyense ashe mano kukunyufwa, kabani muntu utafwambana kwamba, kayi utakalala bwangu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pakwinga ukute kukalala bwangu nkakute kwinsa calulama ico Lesa ncalayandanga sobwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi kamushiyani cinga cakwinsa byasafwana, nekwipa moyo kulikonse. Mwakubomba moyo kamwatambula maswi a Lesa ngalabyala mu myoyo yenu, pakwinga endiwo elakumupulusha. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kamutabowa bantu beshikunyufwa maswi a Lesa, nsombi kamubani beshi kwinsa ncalambanga maswi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pakwinga muntu lanyumfungowa maswi, nsombi kabula kwinsa ncalanyumfunga, welana ne muntu lalibononga mucilola. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Acileka kulanga mucilola popelapo ukute kuluba ncabonekanga. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Milawo ya Lesa yaswepa, kayi ikute kupa muntu kusunguluka. Neco muntu ukute kwatambula nekwakonkela cena, ukute kunyumfwa ne kutalubako, nsombi uyo ukute kwinsa, Lesa nakamupe colwe pa ncito shakendi shonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Na pali muntu layeyengeti washako mano kukukambilila Lesa, nomba katekata mulomo, kukambilila kwa muntuyo nikwabulyo, kayi ukute kulibepa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kukambilila kwakubinga pamenso pa Lesa Bata nuku, kubamba cena bana bamashala, batukashi bamukalubingi mumupensho abo, kayi kulisunga cena, kutalisafwanya mubintu byamucishi capanshi.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Makani a lusalululo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, pakuba ne lushomo muli Yesu Klistu Mwami walemekwa, kamutasalululanga kwelana mbuli muntu ncalabonekenga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mwacilesho, muntu mubile wafwala byakufwala byadula wisa pamubungano, kayi neye muntu mukandu wafwala masempele wisa pamubungano. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mupa bulemu muntu mubile wafwala cena, nekumwambileti, “Kwesa kuno wikale pacipuna cabulemu.” Nendi mukandu wafwala masempele mumwambileti, “Imana nanshi, nambi kwesa wikale panshi kumyendo yakame.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwinseco nikusalulula pakati penu, kayi nikombolosha kwashimpa pa miyeyo yaipa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kamunyumfwani, mobanse bame, Lesa walasala bantu bakute kuboneketi bakandu pamenso abantu bamucishici, kwambeti babe babile mulushomo, kayi kwambeti bakatambule Bwami Lesa mbwalashomesha bamusuni. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba amwe mulasampulunga bakandu! Anu nibani balamutyankilinga panshi nekumukwekweshela ku nkuta? Sena ntebo babile? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sena ntebo bamobamo balasampulunga Lina lyalemekwa lya Klistu ilyo ndyomwinga kukwiwa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ingaciba cena nakamwinsa calulama mwanyumfwilanga mulawo unene wa Bwami bwa Lesa, ukute kucanika mu Mabala, ulambangeti, “Suna munobe mbuli ncolisuni.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nomba mwasalululanga okwambeti mulepishinga, kayi Milawo ya Lesa ikute kumutoteka kwambeti mulapwaya Mulawo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Muntu lakonkelenga Milawo apwayapo umo, okwambeti lapwaya yonse. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lesa walambeti, “Kotapombola,” Kayi walambeti, “Kotashina.” Lino na nkamupombolo, nomba kwalo kushina kamushina, ekwambeti mulapwaya Mila. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lino amwe kamwambanga nekwinsa bintu mbulyeti bantu beti bakomboloshewe ne Lesa pakukonka Mulawo ulapanga kusunguluka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Muntu lomboloshonga mwakubula nkumbo, neye Lesa nakamomboloshe mwakubula nkumbo. Nomba wankumbo uliya cebo ncelela kutinina lombolosho lwa Lesa.</para>
  <para style="s">Lushomo ne ncito shakendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, caina nicipeyo, na muntu wambeti, “Nkute lushomo,” Sena lushomo lulico lwabula ncito ngalumupulusha? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mwacilesho, mwanse mutuloba nambi mutukashi wabula byakufwala, kayi wabula cakulya camukwanina masuba onse, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lino umo pakati penu umwambileti, “Kamuyani mulumuno, muye mulungulilwe nekwikuta” Mubula kumunyamfwako bintu mbyabulilwa, nilunyamfo cini ndomulamunyamfwa? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neco lushomo palonka lwabula ncito lwafwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mpani umbi ngawambeti, “Amwe mukute lushomo, ame nkute ncito shaina.” Ame ndimukumbuleti, “Kondesha Lushomo lwakobe lwabula ncito, ame ndikuleshe lushomo lwakame lukute ncito.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Sena mwashometi pali Lesa umowa? Ee nicakubinga! Nayo mishimu yaipa yashoma kayi ikute kututuma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Obe muluya! Ulayandanga bumboni bwakwambeti lushomo lwabula ncito nilwabulyo? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ntepasa Abulahamu, mushali wetu walaba walulama pamenso a Lesa cebo ca ncito nshalikwinsa ntepasa walabenga Isake mwanendi pa nteme? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Apa ulabono kwambeti lushomo lukute kwendela pamo ne ncito. Ncito shakendi shalasandula lushomo lwakendi kwambeti lushike mpolwalikuyandika. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Munshila ilico byonse byalikwamba Mabala byakwambeti, “Abulahamu walashoma Lesa, ecalapeti Lesa amuboneti walulama” Ecebo cakendi walakwiweti, munendi Lesa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mulaboneti, ncito shakendi muntu eshikute kupesheti abe walulama pamenso pa Lesa, ntelo lushomo lonka sobwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ntepasa kayi calenshika kuli Lahabi mutukashi mupombo, neye walabatambula cena basa beshikwena cishi baci Islayeli, walabapulusha ne kubambileti bapite kanshila mbali pakubwelela kwabo, walacaniketi walulama pamenso a Lesa, cebo cabintu mbyalensa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lino mbuli mubili wabula mushimu wafwa, nalo lushomo lwabula ncito lwafwa.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mulaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, kamutafula mobeshikwiyisha, pakwinga tobeshikwiyisha nitukomboloshewe mwakutuyumina moyo kupita bantu nabambi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Twense tukute kwipisha mubintu bingi. Na mpwali utalisuntulu pakwamba, okwambeti uyo walulama, pakwinga wela kukonsha kwendelesha cena mubili wakendi wonse. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tukute kubika kela kang'anowa mukanwa mwa Lihaki kwambeti litunyumfwilenga kayi nekukonsha kututwala kulikonse nkotulayandanga kuya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kayi kamubonani bwato, nambi nibunene kayi bukute kunyakwa ne mpepo, nsombi bukute kunyonwa nekatondo kakukwashusha, kwambeti bwenga kulikonse nkwalayandanga labwendeleshenga. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Neco nicimocimo ne lulemi. Nikabela kang'ana, nsombi kakute kulitunta ne kwinsa bintu binene.</para>
  <para style="p">Kayi kamubonani kukonempa kwa cisuwa, nsombi cikute kupya ne kamumuni kang'ana ka mulilo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neco nalo lulemi lulyeti mulilo. Pakwinga luli mukati mumubili wetu, lukute kumwaya bintu byaipa mumubili wonse. Lukute kwipisha bwikalo bwa muntu. Lukute kutenta buyumi bwetu bonse kufuma mpotwalasemwa mpaka pakufwa, mulilowo ukute kufumina ku Gehena. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Muntu ngaucikonsha kusuwa banyama bamushobo uliwonse, nambi mushobo wabikeni, nambi mushobo wabishi kukalaba, nambi mushobo wa bintu byamumenshi pakwinga walabisuwapo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nsombi paliya muntu wela kukonsha kuwendelesha lulemi. Lulemi lwaipa, nkalusungwa, lwesula nebusungu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ne lulemi tukute kulumba Lesa Bameshetu, nomba kayi ne lulemi lopelolo tukute kushingana banetu mbwalabumba Lesa, abo bakoshana nendi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pamulomo umoumo pakute kufuma kulumba, nekushingana. Mobanse bame, ibi kabitenshikanga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Sena pamukalo umoumo ngapafuma menshi aina, kayi ne alula? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mobanse bame sena citondo ca mukuyu ingacisema bisepo bya mbula, nambi citondo camutumbi ngacikata nkuyu? Cimocimo mukalo wa menshi amucele nkela kupulisha menshi aina.</para>
  <para style="s">Mano alafumunga kwilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Niyani ukute mano kayi ukute kunyumfwisha bintu? Aboneshe mikalilo yakendi yaina, nekwinsa bintu mwakulicepesha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba mwakutenga moyo wamunyono ne wakulibona buntu, kamutalitunta pakutotekeshana necancine ncine pakwamba bwepeshi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mano alico ntewo akute kufuma kwilu sobwe, akute kufuma kubantu nekumishimu yaipa yapano pacishi capanshi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pakwinga pali munyono, nekulibona buntu, pali minyungwe nencito yaipa yamushobo uliwonse. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nomba mano alafumunga kwilu, cakutanguna akute kuba alulama, alumuno, kayi akulicepesha, kayi eshikunyumfwa. Mano ankumbo, akute kusema bisepo byaina. Mano alico nkasalululu, nambi kulibonesha. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Neco mbuto shikute kubyalwa ne bantu mulumuno shikute kuleta bululami.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bwineshi ne cishi capanshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Inga nkondo shilafumunga kupeyo? Inga kutotekeshana pakati penu kulafumunga kupeyo? Ntepasa shilafumunga mu lunkumbwa lwa mubili, ebilalwananga mulinjamwe? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mukute kuyanda bintu nsombi bikute kumutaika, ecebo cakendi mukute kuyanda kushina, mukute kuyandishisha bintu, nsombi nkamukute kubicana, neco mukute kulondola nekulwana. Nkamukute kucana mbyomulayandanga pakwinga nkamukute kusenga Lesa kwambeti amupe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kayi mwasenganga, nkamukute kutambula, pakwinga miyeyo yenu yaipa. Mukute kusenga bintu kwambeti musebenseshe mubintu byalunkumbwa lwakumubili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Amwe bantu babula lushomo, sena nkamucisheti cibusa ne cishi nikuba mulwani ne Lesa? Neco muntu layandanga cibusa ne cishi layandanga kuba mulwani wa Lesa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Sena mulayeyeti cikute kwamba Mabala nibwepeshi cakwambeti, “Mushimu Lesa ngwabika mulinjafwe utusuni kayi ukute bufuba palinjafwe?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba necikabeco, nkumbo sha Lesa nishangofu. Mbuli Mabala ncalambangeti, “Lesa nkasuni beshikulisumpula, beshikulicepesha embwakute kupa nkumbo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Neco kamulibombeleshani kuli Lesa, tinganani ne Satana, neye nakamufwambe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kamuseng'enani kuli Lesa, neye nakaseng'ene kuli njamwe. Amwe beshibwipishi! Sambani kumakasa. Swepeshani myoyo yenu amwe bandemishibili! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kamulitibuka mobene, nyumfwani nsoni, kayi lilani misoshi. Kuseka kwenu kube kulila, kayi kukondwa kwenu kube nsoni. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mwalicepesha kuli Lesa, neye nakamusumpule.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutombolosha mwanse wenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, kamutambananga byaipa umo ne munendi, nambi komboloshana. Mwenseco mulomboloshonga Milawo ya Lesa. Womboloshanga Milawo ya Lesa ekwambeti nkolenshinga cilambanga Milawo, ulabanga momboloshi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lesa eukute kupa Milawo kayi emomboloshi. Endiye wela kupulusha kayi nekushina. Njobe bani olomboloshonga munobe?</para>
  <para style="s">Kwipa kwakutwanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lino kamunyumfwani amwe mulambangeti, “Lelo nambi Lilo” Tukenga kumunshi unene wakuti wakuti, twenga twikaleko caka cakabumbulu, katwinsa makwebo nekucana mali angi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nkamukute kwishiba ceti cikenshike lilo.Inga buyumi bwenu bulyeconi? Mulyeti bwishi bukute kubonekowa kwacindi cing'ana nekushimangana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Amwe mwela kwambeti, “Mwami Lesa akatusuminisha kuba nebuyumi nitukense ici ne ico” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nomba pacino cindi mulalisumpulunga, kulisumpula kulico kwaipa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Muntu eshiba bintu byaina byakwinsa, nomba ubula kubinsa ukute mulandu.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lacenjeshenga babile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino amwe babile, kamunyumfwani. Lilani ne kompolola cebo ca mapensho alesanga palinjamwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Buboni bwenu bulabolo, muswa ulali byakufwala byenu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mali enu alaba ne ndala kayi yopeleyo ndala eshikabe kamboni, nikalye mibili yenu eti mulilo. Mulabunganya mali angi mumasuba ano akumapwililisho. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Muliya kubafolesha basebenshi basebensanga mumabala enu sobwe. Nyumfwani kutongauka kwabo! Kulila kwabo beshikubunganya bishango byenu kulashiki ku matwi a Lesa Mwami wangofu shonse. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Buyumi bwenu pano pacishi capanshi bwesula ne byakulya byaina. Mulansuku pabusuba bwakumushina. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mulombolosho ne kushina muntu walulama, neye liya kukanapo sobwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutatenkana ne kupaila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino mobansebame, pembelelani mpaka Mwami akese. Bonani ncakute kwinsa mulimi, ukute kupembelela kuloka kwa mfula yanshimalupya ne mfula yalondansoke kwambeti byalimwa bikome cena mulibala. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco nenjamwe pembelelani kayi yumishani myoyo, pakwinga Mwami ulipepi kwisa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kamutatongaukanga pakati penu, kutineti Lesa ngaumombolosha. Bonani shikombolosha wemana kendi pacishinga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mobansebame, anukani cilesho ca bashinshimi balikwamba mulina lya Mwami. Balacana mapensho, nsombi baliya kubwelela kunyuma. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bantu mbotukute kwambeti bakute colwe nibantu balikuba balimbikila. Mwalanyumfwa sha Yobu ncalalimbikila, kayi mucishi Lesa ncalamwinshila pamapwililisho pakwinga Lesa niwankumbo kayi waina moyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba kupita byonse, kamutalumbilanga mwalayananga, kamutalumbilangeti, kwilu nambi cishi capanshi, nambi cintu ciliconse. Amwe mwasuminishanga kamwambangoweti, “Ee” Mwakananga kamwambangoweti, “Sobwe” Kutineti Lesa ngaumucana nemulandu wakumombolosha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Sena pali muntu uli mumapensho? Kapailani. Sena pali wakondwa? Aimbile nyimbo sha kulumbanya Lesa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Sena pali muntu lakolwanga? Kakuwani bamakulene bamubungano, bese bamupailileko nekumunanika mafuta mu lina lya Mwami. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mupailo walushomo lulico nukamupulushe mulwashi, Mwami nakamubweshele ngofu, kayi bwipishi mbwalensa nibukalekelelwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Neco kamuyubululananga bwipishi ne kupaililana kwambeti mubenga ne buyumi bwaina. Pakwinga mupailo wa muntu walulama ukute ngofu, kayi nkaukute kuba wabulyo sobwe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Eliya walikuba muntu ulyeti afwe, mpwalapaileti mfula kaitaloka, cakubinga mfula iliya kuloka kwa byaka bitatu ne myenshi isanu ne umo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nomba kayi mpwalapaila imfula yalaloka ne kumenesha mbuto. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mobansebame, na umbi utaika nekushiya cancinencine, munendi amubweshe, <verse number="20" style="v"/>ishibani kwambeti uliyense labweshe mwipishi kuleka nshila yaipa, lapulushu buyumi bwa muntuyo ku lufu, kayi bwipishi bwingi nibukalekelelwe.</para>
</usx>
